"updated_at":"2023-10-27T23:55:27Z","body":"Thanks. There were a number of memory-related fixes [between OpenSSL v3.0.3 and v3.0.4](https://github.com/openssl/openssl/compare/openssl-3.0.3...openssl-3.0.4) which may play into why this behavior is exhibited when using threading.\r\n\r\nFor now our fix will be to use Ubuntu > 23.04.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/1783621312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]